      {
        "topic": "Counter and cache timing",
        "formal_locations": [
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/懲罰齊射/README.md:9-27",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/懲罰齊射/weapon_trait_bespoke_autogun_p1_followup_shots_ranged_weakspot_damage.md",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/懲罰齊射/weapon_trait_bespoke_lasgun_p3_followup_shots_ranged_weakspot_damage.md",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/懲罰齊射/weapon_trait_bespoke_shotgun_p4_followup_shots_ranged_weakspot_damage.md"
        ],
        "conclusion": "Accepted. Auto/Las use num_shots 1–3 with cache timing stated separately: after a settled clear, the first shot is count 0 and shots 2–4 qualify; a body hit or miss still consumes the shot count. P4 clones the weakspot wrapper and sets use_combo=true; ordinary idle-start count 0 differs from reload/special-load/aim transition first-shell count 1. Its final pellet batch reads then-current live stats, so the transition-shell exception is conditional on crossing the Buff update; post-action combo clearing is strict >0.2 seconds and distinct from the shotgun spread timer."
      },
      {
        "topic": "Damage formula",
        "formal_locations": [
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/懲罰齊射/DAMAGE_PERCENTAGE_REVIEW.md:5",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/懲罰齊射/README.md:31-37"
        ],
        "conclusion": "Accepted. Tier IV adds 0.50 to the ranged_weakspot_damage coefficient on the merged weakspot-plus-critical base_finesse_damage extra portion W: W_after=W×(1+q+r). Same-class coefficients add; the example 100×(1+0.20+0.50)=170 is consistent with a 120 baseline extra portion, and the basic damage B/final whole hit is not multiplied by this coefficient."
      },
      {
        "topic": "Own tiers and RAW reconstruction",
        "formal_locations": [
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/懲罰齊射/TIER_VALUES.md",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/懲罰齊射/LOCALIZATION_COMPARISON.md"
        ],
        "conclusion": "Accepted. All three variants use I–IV 35/40/45/50%; the own tier conditional values and P4 use_combo override are represented. English and Traditional Chinese keys/hashes match the fixed source; each tier reconstruction states the exact Second, Third and Fourth shots wording and its localized counterpart. The documented P4 transition first-shell case is narrowly stated as the implementation exception to RAW ordinals."
      },
      {
        "topic": "Actual bindings, reverse pages and image",
        "formal_locations": [
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/entries/懲罰齊射/WEAPON_COMPATIBILITY.md",
          "Game Info/releases/1.13.X/blessings/data/BLESSING_WEAPON_MAP.json",
          "Referneces/Translation.md"
        ],
        "conclusion": "Accepted. Three full trait IDs resolve to the eight UI-reviewed marks (3 Autogun, 3 Recon Lasgun, 2 Exterminator Shotgun); model names, import/ukey/append paths and map/reverse/index relations agree. The config and generated extension configuration are byte-structure equivalent as JSON. The icon ID/path and verified image attachment are separate fields."
